*.s[ac]ss
*.css
!input.scss
!crates/static/_index.scss
# ...and the stylesheets CI scripts compile, such as the Foundation probe.
!.github/scripts/*.scss
# ...and the browser demo's own stylesheets, which are part of the site rather
# than build output.
!docs/demo/**/*.s[ac]ss
!docs/demo/**/*.css
# ...and the documentation site's theme, whose stylesheet is its source. Accent
# compiles it with accent-sass at build time.
!docs/themes/**/*.s[ac]ss
!docs/themes/**/*.css

# devops
/target
# The demo's wasm package and framework bundles, rebuilt by
# .github/workflows/pages.yml. Binaries and vendored framework sources do not
# belong in the tree; `pkg` below already covers the wasm-pack output.
/docs/demo/vendor
# The documentation site's build output and Accent's caches.
/docs/output
/docs/.build-manifest.json
/docs/.media-cache
/docs/.diagram-cache
coverage
pkg
flamegraph.svg
perf*
dhat*
*.tar.gz

# editor specific
.idea
.vscode

# automation tools
*.py
*.sh
# ...but CI scripts are part of the repository.
!.github/scripts/*.sh
*.cmd
*.exe

# common Sass frameworks that may wish to live alongside accent-sass for testing
susy
bulma*
bootstrap*
materialize
uikit
bourbon
foundation-sites
sassline
true
dart-sass
sass-fairy
duomo
ibm-cloud-cognitive
pico
